; Random selections of lines and hunks, staged, unstaged and discarded,
; over rounds of random edits: CRLF files, files without a final
; newline, renames, new and deleted files, and staged and unstaged
; changes in one file.
> (let ([r (run-random! "random" 1 8 40)]) (list (> (cadr r) 250) (cadddr r)))
(#t ())
